# TUI cross-compiled build outputs (native aria-tui is committed; these build on-demand)
# Go build artifacts — rebuild with `cd tui && make build` (or make build-darwin).
# tui/aria-tui was previously TRACKED, an 11 MB binary re-committed on every
# rebuild while its darwin sibling was already ignored. Untracked 2026-07-26 for
# consistency; `aria tui` falls through to PATH when the repo copy is absent,
# and `make install` puts it in ~/.local/bin.
tui/aria-tui
tui/aria-tui-linux-amd64
tui/aria-tui-darwin-arm64
tui/aria-tui-linux-amd64

# docgen output (generated documents)
aria-documents/

# .env backups — these hold live API keys, same as .env itself
.env.bak-*

